Checks a GitHub repository for Dasharo (coreboot) firmware builds for
PC Engines apu2, apu3, apu4 and apu6 boards, announces new versions in the
system status, and flashes them from the web interface: download, sha256
verification, backup of the current firmware, flashrom write and verify,
then a remote cold reset.

